# Production build variables for the dashboard. Nothing here is secret: every value is
# baked into the public JavaScript bundle by Vite at build time.
#
# In production the Worker (src/worker.ts) proxies /api, /v1, /app, /openapi.json, /docs
# and /health to the API, so the dashboard calls its own origin and needs NO build
# variable. Leave VITE_API_URL unset. The API location is API_UPSTREAM in wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Set VITE_API_URL only for a build that must call an API on another origin (then the API
# needs CORS and the session cookie becomes third-party, which breaks Google sign-in).
# Cloudflare would need it as a BUILD variable and a rebuild after any change.
# VITE_API_URL=https://postrail-api.onrender.com
